<parameterdescription>
<para>Set of positions that the set of particles can have in the grid (points of the grid). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">orientations</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Orientations of the particles in in the grid </para>
